### post budget
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "100 week budget",
    "income": 40000,
    "end_date": "2026-09-24"
}

### get all budgets
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### get budget
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets/4
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### create category
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "budgetId": 3,
    "name": "eletricity"
}

### get all categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/3
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


