}

### list all transactions by budget id and filter by category id or data
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/5?categoryId=6&date=2026-09-16
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### get the daily summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/dailySummaries/10
